Subject: Re: BIC ML versus MLR
Message-ID: <0fXWdJ4mjzo.vfFfONqkAAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <0fXWdJ4mjzo.J9u-fH5ZBQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
