Subject: Re: growth() model with two groups: equality constraints and 'group = '
Message-ID: <SuPoUUKWraY.O9nCn8Y5AAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <SuPoUUKWraY.G-gPmAaXCAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
