From u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com  Thu Oct 19 12:25:05 2017
From: u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com (Terrence Jorgensen)
Date: Thu, 19 Oct 2017 12:25:05 +0000
Subject: Re: lavaan vs blavaan
Message-ID: <vOxehJBcirA.rJioNL2XAAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <vOxehJBcirA.2uSuUTdHAAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
References: <vOxehJBcirA.2uSuUTdHAAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
