Do the degrees of freedom differ at all between the models? It looks like maybe the second model saves 1 DF. If DF are the same, then the models are equivalent. If not, then only the constraints imposed could change the loading estimates. And if the imposed constraints conform to the data, there is no reason to expect any changes in loadings.

